      "sourceText": "1. **单行注释**：`// 描述信息` \n   - 通常放在一行代码的上方，或者一条语句的末尾，==对该行代码说明==\n2. **多行注释**： `/* 描述信息 */`\n   - 通常放在一段代码的上方，==对该段代码做整体说明==",
      "translatedText": "1. **Single\\-line comment**：`// 描述信息` \n   - Usually placed above a line of code, or at the end of a statement, ==to explain that line of code==\n2. **Multi\\-line comment**： `/* 描述信息 */`\n   - Usually placed above a block of code, ==to provide an overall explanation of that block of code==",
